LOCUS       T7BDB5_1_p4798_B       10788 bp DNA     circular SYN 23-AUG-2024
DEFINITION  Created by Sheri Harari. This plasmid is based on 4798, which is 
            4016(ExtGag) that had BsmBI sites removed. BsmBI sites were 
            re-introduced with HiFi on either end of mCherry to be able to 
            accept GoldenGate Cloning inserts VEP.
